      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "U.S. Route 501 cuts through Halifax on Main Street, linking it five miles south to South Boston and 55 miles north to Lynchburg.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        25
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Halifax%2C_Virginia",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "poor",
      "qualityReason": "route_only"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Every year the Halifax County Museum hosts a Civil War & Military Collectors Show that attracts more than 30 dealers and collectors from across Virginia.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        13,
        14,
        15
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://sbhcmuseum.org/",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "During the show, historian Nathan Richardson brings history to life by portraying Frederick Douglass in a living‑history performance.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        16
